Cell["\<\
The introspection framework provides direct access to the raw registry \
records for any of these physical classes. Extracting this metadata reveals \
exactly what information the dispatcher relies on to route evaluations. Each \
record is a structured association containing the property's shorthand macro \
key, its parent property class, and its engine architecture.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9984707096050367`*^9, 3.998573998400737*^9, 3.9985748281853333`*^9, {
   3.998584256331524*^9, 3.998584258759363*^9}, 3.998591613373498*^9, 
   3.998591978892017*^9},
 CellID->1032478360,ExpressionUUID->"4a102f41-57d5-4c58-9287-c08e8bfd9de7"],

Cell["\<\
Most importantly, these records expose the framework's dual-signature routing \
architecture: every property explicitly defines both a DynamicClass and a \
StaticClass. When a property is queried, the dispatcher evaluates the \
wavepacket's \"Potential\" option and automatically routes the calculation to \
the corresponding mathematical signature.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1762306247,ExpressionUUID->"92137e23-92d5-4375-b3a9-b85efcf89c55"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Extract the complete registry records for the \"StaticParameters\" class to \
observe this metadata.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998470725377934*^9, 3.998574836156925*^9, 
  3.998592000220522*^9},
 CellID->1195928760,ExpressionUUID->"fa2c8eee-5bfc-40e7-a2f0-3a36b1714005"],

