Cell["\<\
To illustrate this extensible architecture, the Classical Trajectory (CT) \
engine subpackage is introduced below. This specific module serves as the \
primary pedagogical example throughout the remainder of this technical note. \
It will be used to illustrate how the central registry's databases manage \
disparate properties, how the namespace bridge prevents symbol shadowing, and \
ultimately, its exact backend codebase is deconstructed piece-by-piece in the \
Math Engines section.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998592621572639*^9, 3.998592626288624*^9}, {
   3.998600470572317*^9, 3.998600475024212*^9}, 3.998600834019534*^9},
 CellID->604199513,ExpressionUUID->"e466c04d-15ab-4b26-ac3a-250c120d948b"],

