Cell["\<\
Because the 1D and CT engines govern completely different physical paradigms\
\[LongDash]a distributed quantum wavepacket versus a discrete classical point \
particle\[LongDash]they register unique property classes and external \
environments. The framework enables explicit filtering by engine type to \
isolate these capabilities.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998491548980443*^9, 3.998568770208632*^9, 3.9985748786416197`*^9, {
   3.9985815611178427`*^9, 3.998581569235589*^9}, 3.998591809603598*^9, {
   3.99859267923869*^9, 3.9985927059337387`*^9}, 3.9985927462699223`*^9, {
   3.998600506218643*^9, 3.998600524824584*^9}, 3.998600856959045*^9},
 CellID->1059968039,ExpressionUUID->"e263ef0a-57b4-4eb3-88e9-e6ea369887e8"],

