Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Potential Model Metadata", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998477788869197*^9, 3.998477795772394*^9}, {
  3.998588120143601*^9, 3.99858812254195*^9}},
 CellID->80293685,ExpressionUUID->"6ca4d7c4-af8d-46be-b61b-4b705de8e6a9"],

Cell["\<\
Registering external potentials requires a different data structure because \
potentials act as active, analytical time-evolution operators. Engines manage \
these environments by defining a 4-element potential chunk: {StringName, \
BackendSymbol, Template, Category}.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99850874442581*^9, 3.9985087541280518`*^9}, 
   3.998508866223083*^9, 3.9985750863171263`*^9, 3.998588141912806*^9},
 CellID->1529697195,ExpressionUUID->"519176cc-5043-49f9-bb4b-cdb293235f7c"],

Cell["\<\
The introspection framework reveals how the different engines have already \
registered their frontend potential environments. \"PotentialNames\" returns \
the simple string aliases, while \"PotentialModels\" returns the formatted \
code strings designed for programmatic mapping.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998588558174251*^9, 3.998588566308126*^9}},
 CellID->1531724580,ExpressionUUID->"92af51c7-9c16-4c58-a26d-b3609216649d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

