Cell["\<\
When GWPRegisterPotentials evaluates an engine's potential chunk, it injects \
the mappings into the unified $GWPPotentials database, separated strictly by \
engine type.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998481811994495*^9, {3.9985081330490847`*^9, 3.998508163335575*^9}, 
