Cell["\<\
Notice that OBJ2 successfully binds \"Free\" to the GWP1DFREE backend engine, \
while OBJ1 leaves the potential state as None.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998605464006466*^9},
 CellID->1105867233,ExpressionUUID->"e77f55a4-a4d0-4ff2-9f13-b5e6c4539bb0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Tier 2: The GWPObject Router:",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " When a GWPObject data structure is queried (e.g., OBJ1[\"RHOX\"]), the \
dispatcher intercepts the query, looks up the metadata in the registry, and \
routes it to the appropriate backend evaluator using polymorphic dispatch. \
The presence of an active potential dictates a critical routing fork."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9985758446026707`*^9, {3.9986047440858727`*^9, 3.9986047618244753`*^9}},
 CellID->1648600011,ExpressionUUID->"955492e9-88a7-4637-b683-c2995a2961ed"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Deconstruct the metadata for the Probability Density (\"RHOX\").\
\>", "MathCaption",
