Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Tier 3: The Signature Evaluator:",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Crucially, the dispatcher avoids hardcoding API overloads by utilizing \
Signature Classes. These categorical mappings dictate the structural behavior \
of the backend evaluator\[LongDash]specifically, whether the mathematical \
function expects a spatial coordinate, a continuous time variable, or a \
recursive integer for derivatives. The GWPPropertyDispatch engine uses \
pattern matching on the selected class to wrap the raw developer math in the \
appropriate pure Function shell."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998575847924151*^9},
 CellID->1035925329,ExpressionUUID->"f85ea101-451a-4aa7-a2f5-5211aae21824"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Evaluate the exact same property on both objects to prove the routing fork. \
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99857538530837*^9, 3.998575496625849*^9}, 
   3.998605436013933*^9},
 CellID->951526822,ExpressionUUID->"2efc06b4-4fd7-437e-8212-66b4019e58bd"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"OBJ1", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<RHOX\>\"", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "[", "x", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"OBJ2", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<RHOX\>\"", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "[", 
   RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "//", "Simplify"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998575398022011*^9, 3.9985753996089277`*^9}, {
  3.998605355902977*^9, 3.99860536675557*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[24]:=",
 CellID->578145,ExpressionUUID->"c8b31a9c-eb44-433e-811d-31de2230cd29"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"-", 
  FractionBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "2"]}]], " ", "x"}], 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]"}]]]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998605267890915*^9, 3.998605379053043*^9, 
  3.998612204525648*^9, 4.000412249979218*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[24]=",
 CellID->1696299892,ExpressionUUID->"ca7fc580-5dee-4db6-adf8-553a9b614c62"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"-", "4"}], " ", 
  SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}], 
     RowBox[{"4", "+", 
      SuperscriptBox["t", "2"]}]]}]], " ", 
  SqrtBox[
   FractionBox["2", "\[Pi]"]], " ", 
  SuperscriptBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    FractionBox["1", 
     RowBox[{"4", "+", 
      SuperscriptBox["t", "2"]}]], ")"}], 
   RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]], " ", "x"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998605267890915*^9, 3.998605379053043*^9, 
  3.998612204525648*^9, 4.000412250024062*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[25]=",
 CellID->1866870919,ExpressionUUID->"ee28a2d2-b8d1-4edc-9268-b0165bb0afbb"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The static object routes to the \"RecursiveSpatial\" signature, returning \
an immediate evaluation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "x", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "74a17d73-c849-4cbc-b5ad-d6692d321511"],
 ". The dynamic object recognizes the active potential and routes to the \
\"Recursive\" signature, returning a pure function of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "x", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2ea6874f-de30-4420-9132-684140b50135"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "t", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "79ab1944-35c3-4814-9cdb-28b4af8e323a"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998605441930122*^9},
 CellID->764582976,ExpressionUUID->"cce9a7c3-a518-45bb-a654-b723cc3b64c7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The Signature Taxonomy", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985125048965054`*^9, 3.9985125112527514`*^9}},
 CellID->1440398832,ExpressionUUID->"eadfb45f-635d-43fd-adcc-d472da7a65e4"],

Cell["\<\
The dispatcher categorizes mathematical properties into distinct signatures. \
This taxonomy guarantees predictable frontend behavior, regardless of which \
underlying physics engine is active. The introspection framework exposes this \
taxonomy, mapping each class to its expected backend Signature and the final \
pure Function it Returns.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998512523166239*^9, 3.998513719277923*^9, 3.9985755668914833`*^9, {
   3.9986055972392406`*^9, 3.998605598900962*^9}, 3.998608754547968*^9, 
   3.998608944114683*^9},
 CellID->958331492,ExpressionUUID->"2fb9b0d4-0dab-4767-b9f6-bd9ae838cb25"],

Cell["\<\
When a potential is active, the wavepacket evolves. Therefore, dynamic \
signatures are heavily structured around returning delayed functions of time \
(e.g., \"Temporal\" handles time-dependent scalars, while \"Recursive\" \
combines an integer order with spatial variables for derivatives).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->605512100,ExpressionUUID->"e81f3dfc-aaf6-4491-b8ae-84dbedfd3ddf"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Filter the signature taxonomy to isolate dynamic classifications.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998511902049135*^9, 3.9985119023307858`*^9}, {
   3.998512544228005*^9, 3.99851254708605*^9}, 3.998608805409058*^9, 
   3.99860996426017*^9},
 CellID->801916162,ExpressionUUID->"56be5a0b-a547-4dcb-bd61-f69278d4687a"],

