Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Extension Subpackages", "Section",
 CellID->1070264272,ExpressionUUID->"284772d5-1493-4bb9-bec9-5e5bdb8f30c2"],

Cell["\<\
Because the framework features a shared vocabulary in the Developer \
namespace, Extensions (like GWPHydrodynamics) act as high-level \
orchestrators. They seamlessly read the active Parameter Bus arrays supplied \
by any engine and generate complex, higher-order physical observables.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998566839238759*^9, 3.998577001509954*^9, 
  3.998611954893565*^9},
 CellID->608592232,ExpressionUUID->"a01fbe80-66fc-4179-b5af-fb41cbc379ae"],

Cell["\<\
Extensions follow a strict sniffing pattern: they dynamically check the \
kernel for active engines (e.g., GWPEngine1D) and only load the corresponding \
functional modules (e.g., GWPHydrodynamics1D) if the parent engine is \
detected, preventing computational overhead from unused features. The \
architecture scales horizontally via these extension subpackages; additional \
physical property classes can be injected directly into the active dispatcher \
simply by loading their respective modules.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9985668306217833`*^9, 3.998577012051874*^9, {3.998611977857338*^9, 
   3.998611983057907*^9}, 3.9986121593604927`*^9},
 CellID->145032563,ExpressionUUID->"c28b0b94-3e5c-4030-afa4-8b71c7d70b94"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Query the 1D property classes before and after loading the GWPHydrodynamics \
package to observe the new physics modules being dynamically appended to the \
registry.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998566808806622*^9, 3.998577024524399*^9, {3.998612029821501*^9, 
   3.9986120333115883`*^9}, 3.998612170081995*^9},
 CellID->1859009890,ExpressionUUID->"dc14132f-f0cf-4e92-b1ab-31bed7e58977"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Classes\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`GWPHydrodynamics`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Classes\>\"", 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998581273060322*^9, 3.9985812814266443`*^9}, {
